                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Annex 1]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Statement by the Czechoslovak Delegation on Article
                        21</hi></head>
                <p>“The Czechoslovak Delegation considers that the alteration from six to eight
                    years in the date of payment of reparations is bound to have no other effect on
                    the provisions of the bilateral agreement on reparations concluded between
                    Hungary and Czechoslovakia than that of obliging Czechoslovakia to extend
                    correspondingly the payment terms fixed by this Agreement.”</p>
            </div>
